    New APIs: tsk_ntfs_usnjopen, tsk_ntfs_usnjentry_walk
    
    tsk_ntfs_usnjopen: opens a NTFS Update Sequence Number Journal file at
    the given location.
    
    tsk_ntfs_usnjentry_walk: walks through the NTFS Update Sequence Number
    Journal previously opened with tsk_ntfs_usnjopen. For each entry, it
    calls the given callback function passing a reference to the entry
    header, to its content and to a user defined pointer.
    
    USN Journals contain precious information regarding the recent changes
    within a NTFS file system. Among the information, file name and inode
    number, timestamp of the change, reason for the change etc.
    
    Signed-off-by: Matteo Cafasso <noxdafox@gmail.com>

